# TURNIP TRUCK: the title offers START WORK and CODES; B goes back to the
# library. On the CODES page (UFO 40 has no terminal) JOYRIDES turns on the
# endless practice drive and BACKWARD turns the reverse steering round; a
# second entry turns a code off, and a wrong one does nothing. While a code
# is on, nothing is saved and no goal is given.
game turnip
wait 20
expect state == 0
expect sel == 0
press DOWN
expect sel == 1
press DOWN
expect sel == 0
press B
wait 40
expect_scene library
game turnip
wait 20
expect save_starts == 0
press DOWN
press A
wait 10
expect state == 1
# a code that doesn't exist
press A
wait 2
expect codes == 0
